37
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:50,450
Back then, you were the one that attacked me.

38
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:52,480
You brought it upon yourself !

39
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,920
Then what's happening today

40
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,960
