46
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:30,280
Go !

47
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,120
Kill him !

48
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:41,640
This is...

49
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,160
Resentment that attacks the Origin Soul ?

50
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:55,840
Why...

51
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:58,360
Why is this thing connected to my soul !?

52
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:02,770
Celestial Guard !

53
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,690
This thing that you refined,

54
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,400
what the hell is it ?

55
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,480
What is it !?

56
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,200
Wang Lin,

57
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,970
