61
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,650
I have been nurturing it with resentment

62
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:29,200
and refining it for 100 years !

63
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,200
Its pain

64
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:36,280
