70
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:48,880
That's why

71
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:52,730
I'm repaying you with a resentful spirit that will follow you forever

72
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:55,400
and make your life worse than death !

73
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:59,080
I changed my appearance using the Celestial Guard's spell

74
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,810
