75
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:04,320
The reason she was able to detect my soul

76
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,880
was because she refined that resentful spirit.

77
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,520
In the beginning, she approached me

78
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,120
to test me.

79
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:15,120
Then, she tried to devour my domain

80
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:16,320
and to kill me.

81
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,360
Now,

82
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,680
