83
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:23,720
to curse me with a resentful spirit !

84
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:31,120
Your soul is severely wounded

85
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:33,440
and you're barely standing.

86
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:35,400
Why don't you give up !?

87
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,650
Whether it's old grudges or this thing...

88
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:40,920
we will

89
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:43,320
settle it all today !

90
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:08,450
If I don't annihilate both your body and soul,

91
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,240
then I'm not Wang Lin !

92
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:24,650
Even the celestial artifact given by Master can barely block it ?

93
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,560
He's only at Early stage Ascendant,

94
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:29,320
