95
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,120
No...

96
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:33,680
This isn't just the power of the spell.

97
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,330
It's also...

98
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,690
his domain !

99
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,840
Seven Stars Sword Formation !

100
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:51,120
Spells can be bestowed,

101
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,800
cultivation can be raised forcefully,

102
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:55,440
artifacts can be given.

103
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,160
Only the domain

104
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:59,160
must be comprehended by yourself !

105
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:02,190
You have a Peak Late stage Ascendant cultivation

106
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:04,920
without truly comprehending your own domain.

107
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,520
In my eyes,

108
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:10,480
you're weaker than a Middle stage Ascendant cultivator !

109
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,200
The Three Metal Soul !

110
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,250
Stop !

111
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:43,400
The Three Metal Soul of my Soul Refining Sect

112
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:46,160
