113
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,880
Stop this !

114
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,200
The Huan Family Ancestor ?

115
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:48,000
If you save her,

116
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:50,120
I'll exterminate the Huan Family !

117
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,960
Arrogant Junior,

118
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:55,800
even if you have an Illusory Yin puppet,

119
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:57,400
you are nothing but an ant

120
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:59,080
