121
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,400
If you keep being insolent,

122
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:06,240
I will destroy your soul !

123
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,090
Slash !

124
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:38,490
Nirvana Cleanser sword energy !?

125
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:47,400
Which crazy Nirvana Cleanser Senior

126
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,560
