127
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,400
to a first step Junior !?

128
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:13,480
If this brat has 6 or more rays of sword energy like that,

129
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:17,000
then unless I recover my Nirvana Scryer cultivation,

130
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:19,440
I will die for sure.

131
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,760
Liu Mei is crucial to completing my Dao.

132
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:27,600
She is my only chance to breakthrough to Nirvana Cleanser in my lifetime.

133
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,440
I can't let her go !

134
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:32,560
The foundation of my Huan Family

135
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:35,000
