136
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:36,280
by a Junior like you !

137
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,520
Old friend Qian,

138
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:44,440
I have a favor to ask.

139
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,320
Master Du Tian,

140
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:59,240
