141
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:01,320
The power of the Soul Flag

142
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:03,210
will be restored one day.

143
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:17,690
You can come out.

144
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,280
Greetings,

145
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,400
Senior.

146
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:29,010
No need for that.

147
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:31,530
Xu...

148
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:32,520
Brother Xu,

149
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:36,160
