152
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:41,320
I...

153
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,560
Where are the others ?

154
00:11:43,920 --> 00:11:45,850
Their avatars have a higher cultivation,

155
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:47,800
