157
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,770
to find another place

158
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:52,530
to continue their bloodlines.

159
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,440
Your foundation was destroyed.

160
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:02,560
Although it's your fault,

161
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:04,800
