162
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,480
is also part of the reason.

163
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,040
I need to settle

164
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,480
this karma.

165
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,480
You have two choices.

166
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:14,680
First option,

167
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:17,130
I help you to reach Soul Transformation.

168
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:18,610
But after that

169
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:20,080
your cultivation will be stuck.

170
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,010
Second option,

171
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:25,760
I'll help you to reach Late stage Nascent Soul.

172
00:12:26,560 --> 00:12:28,290
But to reach Soul Formation,

173
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:30,210
you will be on your own.

174
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,810
That path

175
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:33,410
leaves the road ahead open.

176
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,080
Brother Xu,

177
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:38,120
