178
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:40,010
I barely escaped death

179
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:41,040
when I reached Ascendant.

180
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,400
I don't have the courage

181
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,480
to do it again.

182
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,130
Brother Xu,

183
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:47,800
I'll take the first option.

184
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:48,960
Alright.

185
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:13,730
3 days later

186
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:22,560
Senior.

187
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:29,400
The herbs to paralyze a giant beast ?

188
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:31,400
Such things

189
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:34,720
