190
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,880
Why did you

191
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:40,200
come to me for this matter ?

192
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:42,690
It's a matter of great importance.

193
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,800
In Allheaven,

194
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:45,900
Senior is the only one I trust.

195
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:49,250
If Senior ever needs anything in the future,

196
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:49,930
Junior

197
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,000
will do his best.

198
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,600
Come to think of it,

199
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,400
this old man

200
00:14:03,280 --> 00:14:05,600
does have a favor to ask.

201
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,690
If it's within my power,

202
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:09,010
I promise I'll do it.

203
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:15,050
Planet Thousand Illusions

204
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,280
According to Sun Xi,

205
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,240
on Planet Thousand Illusions,

206
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,920
the Qian Family is the strongest

207
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:20,960
the Huan Family is second,

208
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:22,810
and the Xu Family third.

209
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,840
The Huan Family Ancestor is their only

210
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:26,440
second step cultivator.

211
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:29,240
He must have powerful allies protecting him

212
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:31,410
or artifacts guarding his seat.

213
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:32,800
Or maybe...

214
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:34,960
both.

215
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:37,840
Visitor,

216
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,440
stop there.

217
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:44,800
You,

218
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:48,120
are you here because of the Huan Family ?

219
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,200
Correct.

220
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:54,000
Huan Wuqing has always been stingy

221
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:57,650
Qian Kuizi
Qian Family 3rd Ancestor
Illusory Yin

222
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:57,810
but he was willing to offer the Huan Moon Mirror to hire me.

223
00:14:58,120 --> 00:15:00,000
This Junior's identity

224
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:01,920
must be extraordinary.

225
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:05,120
Such a young age

226
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:08,650
and you're already talking about wiping out a family ?

227
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:11,200
Tell me the name of your Family's elder.

228
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:13,920
Maybe they're an acquaintance of mine

229
00:15:14,160 --> 00:15:16,120
and you can escape death.

230
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,760
This child's cultivation

231
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:23,040
is only Early stage Ascendant ?

232
00:15:31,640 --> 00:15:33,400
It really is an Illusory Yin puppet !

233
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:35,900
Which family would be so generous

234
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:38,040
as to refine an Illusory Yin cultivator into a puppet

235
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:40,600
and give it to a Junior like this ?

236
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:41,760
Senior,

237
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:45,050
this is a personal grudge between me and the Huan Family.

238
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,800
Please don't get involved.

239
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:50,400
Leave this puppet behind

240
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:51,890
and I

241
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:54,080
won't participate in this matter.

242
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,480
Then there is nothing to discuss.

243
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:02,120
I can blame his death

244
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:04,080
on the Huan Family.

245
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:06,280
I must make sure

246
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:08,360
to obtain this puppet.

247
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,240
Good !

248
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:14,800
The body of your puppet has also been refined.

249
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:19,960
Although the Celestial Guard has an Illusory Yin body,

250
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:23,600
he can't contend with a true Illusory Yin.

251
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:25,480
To win this battle,

252
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:28,620
I must use the Seven Stars Sword Formation to restrain him

253
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:30,560
and then use Ling Tianhou's sword energy

254
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:32,010
to defeat him in one strike.

255
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:34,440
I'll start by refining your puppet a little bit !

256
00:16:34,760 --> 00:16:36,400
Thousand Calamity Falling Thunder !

257
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:38,120
This person

258
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:39,240
uses thunder ?

259
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:53,290
Since the Thunder Beast was able to break his spell,

260
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,840
he must be furious.

261
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:56,920
When he reveals an opening,

262
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:58,880
I will kill him with the sword energy.

263
00:16:59,040 --> 00:16:59,880
This is...

264
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,410
a Thunder Beast !

265
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:05,410
You are from the Thunder Celestial Temple !

266
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:07,650
Please forgive me, young friend.

267
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:08,880
This old man was reckless.

268
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:10,090
This is a misunderstanding,

269
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,000
a misunderstanding...

270
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:13,170
A misunderstanding ?

271
00:17:13,040 --> 00:17:14,090
Indeed,

272
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:15,890
my eyesight failed me.

273
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,810
I didn't recognize young friend's identity.

274
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,910
Messenger can rest assured,

275
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:21,210
we will absolutely not interfere

276
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:22,610
in your grudge with the Huan Family.

277
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:24,020
The Qian Family and the Huan Family

278
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:25,010
no longer

279
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:25,760
have any ties !

280
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,830
Saying it was a misunderstanding

281
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:33,890
is not enough.

282
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:36,080
This old man is at fault,

283
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,760
please punish me, Messenger.

284
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:40,570
I want celestial jades.

285
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:41,760
