There are crucial differences between what happened in the novel and the donghua. In the novel, Liu Mei and Wang Lin had sex under the influence of the Thousand Illusions Lust Domain (cf. note of episode 99). Liu Mei cultivates a resentful spirit inside her body for 100 years and then gives birth to it.
This subplot was obviously censored in the donghua which took the route of having Liu Mei steal a part of Wang Lin's soul to make a resentful spirit out of it. The outcome is the same.
